WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.165
Today we will build and repeat a rhythmic pattern. Our work connects with other

00:00:05.165 --> 00:00:05.875
Ghanaian communities.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.324
Mark four beat spaces with dots on paper.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.580
Choose claps and thigh taps to fill the beat spaces.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:19.534
Perform the pattern twice and check for a steady pulse. Compare your result with a

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:20.823
second example from Ghana.
